  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 0.25,
   "t1": 2.85,
   "text": "I donated last week… no idea what it actually did."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 3.05,
   "t1": 5.25,
   "text": "Honestly? Most donors can't easily find out."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 5.4,
   "t1": 8,
   "text": "Scams are rare, but one made-up story raised *$400,000*…"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 8.1,
   "t1": 10,
   "text": "…and paid for a *BMW* and *casino trips*."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 10.2,
